---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';

const title = 'Our Story — From Small Coin to Tanka';
const description = 'The story of Tanka: an idea that began as Small Coin in 2016 and entered a new chapter as an open-source cryptocurrency project in 2026.';
---
<SiteLayout title={title} description={description} active="/about/">
  <section class="container py-20 sm:py-28">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Tanka / Our story</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-5 max-w-5xl text-5xl font-medium leading-tight sm:text-7xl">
      From Small Coin<br />to <span class="text-cyan">Tanka.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-silver/80">
      An idea that began in 2016. A new chapter in 2026.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] lg:gap-20">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The idea behind the name</p>
        <h2 class="display mt-4 text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">
          A long-held vision for everyday digital money.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-silver/70">
          The story of Tanka began in 2016, long before it carried its current name. Originally conceived as <strong class="font-semibold text-white">Small Coin</strong>, the project emerged from an interest in decentralised digital currencies and the possibility of making everyday payments simpler and more accessible.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ol class="relative border-l border-cyan/25 pl-7 sm:pl-10">
        <li class="relative pb-11">
          <span class="absolute -left-[34px] top-1 size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-cyan bg-midnight shadow-[0_0_18px_#12DCE6] sm:-left-[46px]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <p class="eyebrow">2016–2018 / Small Coin</p>
          <h3 class="display mt-3 text-2xl">The first exploration</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-silver/70">
            Between 2016 and 2018, the idea began taking shape through early technical exploration, including work with open-source cryptocurrency technology. The domain <span class="text-silver">smallcoin.co.uk</span> was acquired to establish the project’s original identity.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="relative pb-11">
          <span class="absolute -left-[34px] top-1 size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-cyan bg-midnight sm:-left-[46px]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <p class="eyebrow">2018 / A pause</p>
          <h3 class="display mt-3 text-2xl">The project rests</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-silver/70">
            Personal circumstances brought development to a halt in 2018, and the project remained dormant for several years.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="relative">
          <span class="absolute -left-[34px] top-1 size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-cyan bg-midnight shadow-[0_0_18px_#12DCE6] sm:-left-[46px]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <p class="eyebrow">2026 / Tanka</p>
          <h3 class="display mt-3 text-2xl">A new chapter</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-silver/70">
            In 2026, the original vision was revisited with a clearer purpose and a new identity. <strong class="font-semibold text-white">Small Coin became Tanka.</strong>
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="panel mt-20 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12">
      <p class="eyebrow">Where the journey continues</p>
      <h2 class="display mt-4 max-w-3xl text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">
        The name changed. The ambition remained.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-silver/70">
        Tanka aims to develop an independent digital currency that people can mine, own, send and use in everyday life. Today, it is being re-established as an open-source blockchain engineering initiative, with an emphasis on transparent development, community participation and practical payments.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-silver/70">
        The journey that began as Small Coin continues at <span class="text-cyan">tanka.money</span>.
      </p>
      <p class="display mt-8 text-lg text-white">Mine it. Send it. Spend it.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-9 text-sm leading-6 text-silver/55">
      Tanka is under development. Its blockchain network, mining, wallet, exchange listings and merchant services are not currently operational.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
